  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Livelihood Assistance to Address the Negative Impact of Rising Food Prices in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to ensure that communities will have access to affordable, local produce that can provide essential nutrients that are lacking in their daily diets, produce seeds for planting in the next season, and create a more sustainable production system to help maintain soil fertility.</narrative>
  </description>
